---
import Badge from './ui/Badge.astro';
---

<section class="py-10 md:py-14">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-4 md:px-6">
    <div data-reveal class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-primary/15 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F3F6F2] to-white p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-primary/[0.06] blur-[18px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/[0.03] to-transparent"></div>

      <div class="relative grid lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] gap-6 md:gap-8 items-center">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white border border-border px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span> Doble moneda nativa
          </div>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-sans text-[26px] md:text-[30px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink leading-[1.05]">La tasa no se recalcula. Se congela.</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-[60ch]">
            Cada <span class="font-semibold text-ink">ficha de costo y cada venta</span> guarda un <span class="font-mono text-ink bg-white border border-border rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">snapshot de la tasa CUP/USD</span> en el momento exacto de la operación. El histórico nunca se recalcula con la tasa de hoy y la rentabilidad real queda protegida ante la fluctuación cambiaria.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted">Único frente a Excel con una sola moneda o tasas desactualizadas. Todo en <span class="font-mono font-medium text-ink">CUP y USD, trazable</span>.</p>
          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <Badge variant="success">CUP/USD dual</Badge>
            <Badge variant="info">Snapshot inmutable</Badge>
            <Badge variant="warning">Rentabilidad real</Badge>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- mock tasa -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-border rounded-card shadow-card overflow-hidden">
          <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-border flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-muted">TASA DEL DÍA · SNAPSHOT</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-primary font-semibold">Ejemplo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div class="rounded-[10px] bg-page border border-border p-3">
                <p class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Venta #08471</p>
                <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink">1 USD = 320 CUP</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">12/03/2026 · 09:42</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-[10px] bg-page border border-border p-3">
                <p class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Ficha FC-2026-09</p>
                <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink">1 USD = 318 CUP</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">10/03/2026 · snapshot</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 rounded-[10px] border border-border p-3 bg-white">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[12px]">
                <span class="text-muted">Precio venta</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-ink">2,450 CUP · 7.65 USD</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[12px] mt-1.5">
                <span class="text-muted">Costo unitario</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-ink">1,680 CUP · 5.25 USD</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-border flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-ink">Rentabilidad</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-[13px] font-bold text-primary">+45.8% · +770 CUP</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[11px] font-mono text-muted text-center">El histórico no se recalcula con la tasa de hoy</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
